# PART 18 — ENGINEERING QUALITY

Follow:
- SOLID principles.
- Separation of concerns.
- Single responsibility.
- Repository pattern.
- Strategy pattern for exercise validation.
- Factory pattern where appropriate.
- Observer/reactive state patterns.
- Dependency injection.
- Reusable components.
- Strong TypeScript typing.

Avoid unnecessary abstraction and overengineering.

Do not introduce duplicate services or conflicting state management.

Keep the framework easy to maintain and extend.

